  - startTime: 0
    endTime: 1.7
    text: 'Good Choice! '
  - startTime: 1.7
    endTime: 5.5
    text: 'Building the road around the forrest keeps the pandas home intact! '
  - startTime: 5.5
    endTime: 10
    text: 'But the noise and humans still disturb the panda, and hurts the bamboo. '
